==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{etymon|ru|:inh|sla-pro:*vodìti}}
{{inh+|ru|sla-pro|*voditi||to lead, conduct}}. Cognate with {{cog|en|wed}} and {{m|en|wage}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|води́ть}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-водить.ogg}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-водить2.ogg}}
* {{audio|ru|LL-Q7737 (rus)-Tatiana Kerbush-водить.wav|a=Saint Petersburg}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|води́ть|impf|vn=вожде́ние}}

# to [[lead]], to [[conduct]], to [[guide]]
# to [[drive]]
#: {{uxi|ru|Я не '''вожу́''' автома́т.|I don't '''drive''' automatic.}}
# to [[move]]
# to [[breed]]
# to be [[it]] in [[tag]] and similar games

